</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6ee86de4-8a60-11f1-ba30-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/eiRYYKsl4Jv0Joc2-w3oNuqpYDuGo2YPOmDu5jpg7uY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6ee86de4-8a60-11f1-ba30-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/eiRYYKsl4Jv0Joc2-w3oNuqpYDuGo2YPOmDu5jpg7uY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">0226a816-8a5f-11f1-9419-412fc4e81f3f</guid><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 10:45:15 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>夏榕</dc:creator></item><item><category>社会</category><title>俄副外长：俄中正商讨实施永久免签政策的前景</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A/20260728-%E4%BF%84%E5%89%AF%E5%A4%96%E9%95%BF-%E4%BF%84%E4%B8%AD%E6%AD%A3%E5%95%86%E8%AE%A8%E5%AE%9E%E6%96%BD%E6%B0%B8%E4%B9%85%E5%85%8D%E7%AD%BE%E6%94%BF%E7%AD%96%E5%89%8D%E6%99%AF</link><description>
