</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6dfe94b4-8a77-11f1-b142-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-d-%C3%A9cran-2026-07-28-132631.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6dfe94b4-8a77-11f1-b142-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-d-%C3%A9cran-2026-07-28-132631.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">6ecd5f48-8a76-11f1-871b-8f3c1bd1f0c6</guid><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 11:31:22 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/6dfe94b4-8a77-11f1-b142-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Capture-d-%C3%A9cran-2026-07-28-132631.jpg">© 路透社 发朝鲜KRT电视画面</source><dc:creator>林兰</dc:creator></item><item><category>柏林飞鸿</category><title>中国的人工智能会成为欧洲的福音吗？</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E6%9F%8F%E6%9E%97%E9%A3%9E%E9%B8%BF/20260728-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%BA%E5%B7%A5%E6%99%BA%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%9A%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2%E7%9A%84%E7%A6%8F%E9%9F%B3%E5%90%97</link><description>
